      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "1 stakes",
      "narration_text": "The official plugin catalog covers what most businesses share — marketing, sales, data, support. But your work has a shape none of them anticipated: how you onboard a client, how your proposals are structured, the checklist you review against. No off-the-shelf plugin knows that.",
